                                                "sense_id": "c377dd41-902f-3307-95ed-5c0d0b3467dc",
                                                "text": "He concludes: \"This letter is written in contemplation of legal proceedings, and is a pre-action protocol letter within the meaning of the Civil Procedure Rules 1998.\""
                                            }
